## Implanter Attempt Messages

implanter-component-implanting-target = {CAPITALIZE(THE({$user}))}正试图给你植入什么东西！
implanter-component-draw-target = {CAPITALIZE(THE({$user}))}正试图从你身上提取什么东西！
implanter-component-implant-failed = {$implant}无法给予{$target}！
implanter-draw-failed-permanent = {$implant}在{$target}体内已与{ OBJECT($target) }融合，无法取出！
implanter-draw-failed = 你试图取出植入物，但什么也没找到。
implanter-draw-failed-catastrophically = 植入器什么也没找到并灾难性地失效，把遗传物质注射进了{$user}的手里！
implanter-component-implant-already = {CAPITALIZE(THE({$target}))}已经有{$implant}了！

## UI
implanter-set-draw-verb = 设置植入物取出
implanter-set-draw-window = 设置植入物取出
implanter-set-draw-info = 选择此植入器应取出的植入物类型：
implanter-set-draw-type = 植入物类型：

implanter-draw-text = 取出
implanter-inject-text = 注射

implanter-empty-text = 空

implanter-label-inject = [color=green]{$implantName}[/color]
    模式：[color=white]{$modeString}[/color]

implanter-label-draw = [color=red]{$implantName}[/color]
    模式：[color=white]{$modeString}[/color]

implanter-contained-implant-text = [color=green]{$desc}[/color]
